What is printed?
```
char c = '7';
if (c >= 'a' && c <= 'z')
    printf("letter");
else if (c >= '0' && c <= '9')
    printf("digit");
else
    printf("symbol");
```

What is printed?
```
int n = 6, c = 0;
while (n != 1) {
    if (n % 2 == 0)
        n = n / 2;
    else
        n = 3 * n + 1;
    c++;
}
printf("%d", c);
```

